<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Privilege of the Union</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1423">1423</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a> · Also known as Privilegio de la Unión</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Privilege of the Union was a charter issued by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-iii-of-navarre">Charles III the Noble</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-navarre">Navarre</a> on 8 September 1423 that united the three rival boroughs of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pamplona">Pamplona</a>, the Navarrería, San Cernin and San Nicolás, into a single city. After centuries of conflict between them, it gave Pamplona one council, one coat of arms and a common town hall built between the old boroughs.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/privilege-of-the-union.jpg" alt="Privilege of the Union" width="320" height="427" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Ganesha811 · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Privilege_of_the_Union,_Pamplona_2026_(2).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
